he calls the rest of the class and informs
 them of what he's just learned.

00:12:11.464 --> 00:12:12.732
This blue haired guy here 

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:15.735
calls the main character
 and reveals that he's done some research

00:12:15.735 --> 00:12:19.872
and figured out that the Kings game
 started in a place called Yanakie Village.

00:12:20.106 --> 00:12:23.976
The history of the village was hidden
 after every single villager mysteriously

00:12:23.976 --> 00:12:28.180
