00:12:45.865 --> 00:12:48.400
She attacks the main character
 before coming to her senses.

00:12:48.434 --> 00:12:50.302
He explains what happened to the boyfriend 

00:12:50.302 --> 00:12:53.706
and convinces her to untie him
 saddened by the news.

00:12:53.839 --> 00:12:57.343
She cries and lets the main character
 go before dying of a heart attack.

00:12:57.643 --> 00:13:00.713
OK, so the origin of the Kings
 game started from

00:13:00.713 --> 00:13:03.616
an old abandoned village
 where everyone mysteriously died.

00:13:03.816 --> 00:13:05.351
How is it taken us this long 

00:13:05.351 --> 00:13:09.388
to find out why the way
 we need to tell this to our classmates?

00:13:09.555 --> 00:13:11.590
There's no way I can tackle this alone. 

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:14.994
The Internet will be one of
 our biggest weapons in beating this game.

00:13:15.027 --> 00:13:18.898
Yanagi Village is something that should be
 a piece of Internet folklore.

00:13:18.931 --> 00:13:22.268
All it takes is for a simple post
 on social media websites

00:13:22.401 --> 00:13:25.037
