00:14:04.476 --> 00:14:07.713
I would show them the email
 my blue haired friend sacrificed his life

00:14:07.713 --> 00:14:11.116
for and try my best
 to convince them to tag along.

00:14:11.217 --> 00:14:13.452
If we all go as a group,
 we might have a chance

00:14:13.452 --> 00:14:17.156
of finding some clues in the village
 that would help us with beating the king.

00:14:17.189 --> 00:14:19.892
Maybe some previous players
 of the game left some notes

00:14:19.892 --> 00:14:21.493
in their houses before dying. 

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:24.964
Utilizing the group to help search
 for more clues will ensure we get this

00:14:24.964 --> 00:14:28.767
show on the road and get to the bottom
 of this as every minute counts.

00:14:29.168 --> 00:14:32.771
And while the group is busy searching,
 I would sneakily put on some goggles

00:14:32.771 --> 00:14:35.541
and make my way to the kitchen
 to chop onions. Why?

00:14:35.741 --> 00:14:40.179
Well, the chemical released from chopped
 onions is called Antheil s oxide,

00:14:40.312 --> 00:14:44.016
and it is a latra meter which stimulates
 the tear glands and makes you cry.

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:46.752
This means we can easily
 prepare unnatural tear gas,

00:14:46.819 --> 00:14:49.021
and when I invite
 to the other students to dinner,

00:14:49.121 --> 00:14:51.190
they'll have a nasty surprise
 waiting for them. 

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:54.760
We can even bring with us some pepper
 spray in case there are some stragglers

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:58.097
who succeed in holding their tears
 in and ensure our victory.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.499
But personally, I think
 the onions are more fun.

00:15:00.633 --> 00:15:03.035
It might sound cold blooded,
 and that's because it is.

00:15:03.068 --> 00:15:04.403
But this is life and death. 

00:15:04.403 --> 00:15:07.072
And now that we know, crying forces
 you to. Lose the game.

00:15:07.106 --> 00:15:12.177
It's a golden opportunity that we can't
 afford to waste, the next order is sent.

00:15:12.311 --> 00:15:15.114
One of the members of the class
 will volunteer to roll the dice.

00:15:15.147 --> 00:15:15.915
Whatever number is 

00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:18.884
given will be the amount of people
 who will die along with the roller.

00:15:18.951 --> 00:15:22.021
The roller is to voice out
 the names of those he or she wants dead.

00:15:22.221 --> 00:15:25.224
The group gathers at a park by the dam
 and know who's best friend.

00:15:25.257 --> 00:15:27.259
Here is the one who takes the bullet. 

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:31.563
He rolls the dice and is unlucky enough
 to get a six to ensure his safety.

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:34.500
This ugly guy here snatches chisme,
 stabbing her in the leg.

00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:36.869
The group starts arguing and chaos ensues.

00:15:37.102 --> 00:15:39.972
The best friend accidentally says
 the name of the short kid here

00:15:39.972 --> 00:15:41.340
