00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:44.376
His neck spins around his head
 like a steering wheel until it falls off.

00:15:44.376 --> 00:15:46.946
And, well, pop goes
 the weasel. Sucks to be him.

00:15:47.046 --> 00:15:51.016
The best friend picks a sick girl who's
