00:15:51.283 --> 00:15:53.385
This brown haired girl
 and the angry looking one.

00:15:53.419 --> 00:15:55.454
Here are the next to meet their demise.

00:15:55.487 --> 00:15:58.390
With the situation at hand,
 there aren't many options left.

00:15:58.524 --> 00:16:00.859
This ugly guy here
 is about to force the best friend

00:16:00.993 --> 00:16:02.928
