00:16:22.481 --> 00:16:24.483
Now there are only three remaining. 

00:16:24.483 --> 00:16:25.351
This white haired 

00:16:25.351 --> 00:16:28.287
girl hair whips out a laptop and reveals
 that she's been researching

00:16:28.354 --> 00:16:31.623
