 since the game never ended in the village.

00:16:57.816 --> 00:17:01.553
The virus evolved to spread
 from biological to technological means.

00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:05.691
This is why now has the ability to infect
 people through electronic devices.

00:17:05.724 --> 00:17:07.292
She notices one more thing. 

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:08.660
Everyone who was killed in the game 

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:12.531
