 from the king before they get punished.

00:17:12.631 --> 00:17:14.967
But she doesn't know what it means yet. 

00:17:14.967 --> 00:17:18.670
She tries using an antivirus program
 to exploit a bug that she found

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:20.139
