00:17:20.139 --> 00:17:22.207
But the king is full of surprises.

00:17:22.741 --> 00:17:26.078
She's punished for breaking
 one of the rules set from the very start.

00:17:26.311 --> 00:17:28.113
No quitting allowed. 

00:17:28.113 --> 00:17:32.551
She instantly catches on fire and
 is burnt alive for trying to end the game.

00:17:32.851 --> 00:17:36.455
It turns out the bug was a trap set
