 while taking small breaks for air.

00:19:02.941 --> 00:19:05.110
The king may decide
 to let up after a while.

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.680
Nobu and Shimmy are now the final
 two players of the Kings game.

00:19:08.747 --> 00:19:13.252
The last order is simple and a most cruel
 kill the person you love most.

00:19:13.485 --> 00:19:15.254
In the end, Chemi chooses 

00:19:15.254 --> 00:19:18.290
to sacrifice herself in order
 to save the main character's life.

00:19:18.323 --> 00:19:19.892
Even though Jianmei might not have been 

00:19:19.892 --> 00:19:23.295
