 now the last man standing.

00:19:23.462 --> 00:19:27.299
Suddenly, he receives his final message
 Continue the Kings game

00:19:27.399 --> 00:19:29.801
or choose to be punished. 

00:19:29.801 --> 00:19:33.205
Some time later,
 we see Naboo moving to a new school.

00:19:33.505 --> 00:19:35.507
His first day of school is like any other. 

00:19:35.507 --> 00:19:37.476
But after all that he's
 seen in the king's game, 

00:19:37.476 --> 00:19:40.112
