 he's about to hit the hay.

00:19:50.556 --> 00:19:52.124
The clock hits midnight. 

00:19:52.124 --> 00:19:56.295
A text is sent to the class stating
 This is the king's game.

00:19:56.962 --> 00:19:59.097
The king's orders are absolute. 

00:19:59.097 --> 00:20:02.201
You have 24 hours
 and quitting is not an option.

00:20:03.001 --> 00:20:05.771
Looks like he chose
 the first option to continue.

00:20:06.238 --> 00:20:10.242
It's time for the next game,
 and by the end of it,

00:20:10.375 --> 00:20:13.378
